  "summary": "Fixes an intermittent race condition failure in the functional test `p2p_initial_headers_sync.py`. It wraps the recipient assertion inside `self.wait_until()` so the test waits for the node to send the expected `getheaders` message rather than immediately asserting that one peer has already received it.",
